    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eefde9184b167f352be24fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……啊，这本杂志。\n是杏目前辈的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "30136b5ef4062385a1a91060a5c1d49087ce35029f150c55d1736093bd256012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c06bdf9e2e3816a504357f96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我沿着放声欢呼的视线看去，\n有一本杂志的封面上写着杏目的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62da83f1ae0eedd4851107292a7c0cab79072009ccec4a8221d1824f80b0e6c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c592c7c795af0ebda96b386e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名字旁边的标题是「宣布放弃凯旋门赏」。\n不久前，杏目在记者会上发表了\n她不会参加「凯旋门赏」的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13970a0e9816959a71e5445c6e1dd2b1063c6cfbf9c9ed66f6f7cfda91a8563e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc27606cf7ce598ed6b5c38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟那边的草地跟路基都完全不同",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da1abef795893ac442f81ebc4262d84f450ce713deb0e3cc4708011e9925722",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
