    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257bb102648f61fb7373e8e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她当时说的弃赛理由，\n是她在资质上不适合参赛对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce68e1ed290436f4a8f78c20d15052b01ac6b8a4b2788ec6382e0c0b2b085548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69614c7a90003cf22626e512",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "国外竞赛无论是赛道特性还是比赛节奏\n都跟日本有很大的差异。\n可以说比国内竞赛更讲究资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0620514b18ac1f64a26ba4ec22af723b0fa4425869c1d883dd3bd29d30af33f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131308.json",
      "json_path": [
